There are a few threads in the group about crawlers and robots.txt, e.g. https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shinyapps-users/UtRAfVXUtbU/9EgpNTwhFAAJ

Short answer is that we don't allow bots to crawl shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> because they don't actually make the additional calls to obtain the content and therefore cause useless load on the system and consumer accounts' hours with no benefit.

